  <prompt>Owner 2026-11-27 decision D-235: once task 232 is on dev (dev BFF 5cd40984b0 carries it), list the matters and projects that have an open base-derived finance Threshold Signal (spend, budget or utilization; SignalReevaluationJob.RollupSubjectOf), and call the existing POST /api/finance/{matters|projects}/{id}/recalculate once for each. Read-only listing first; record counts (no ids in public) in notes/task-236-notes.md.</prompt>
  <role>Main session ontology-r1.</role>
  <goal>Every matter or project form with an open finance Threshold Signal shows the same roll-up figures the Signal was raised on.</goal>
  <context><background>Never write the roll-up columns directly; only the route (FinanceRollupService, unchanged-write skip). One call per record (D-61). Stop on any non-404 failure and report.</background></context>
