  <completion>Done 2026-11-27 (main session, dev BFF 5cd40984b0 with task 232): read-only listing found no spend, budget or utilization Threshold policy on dev (676 open Signals, 7 policies, 10 policy versions; none names a derived finance column), so 0 subjects needed recalculation and no call or write was made. Notes: notes/task-236-notes.md.</completion>
